362	     * {@link #getEmail() email} is present; adds {@code 1} when {@link #getNamesakeCount()
363	     * namesakeCount} is {@code 0}; adds {@code 2} for a household of {@code 3} or more members
364	     * ({@link #getHouseholdSize() householdSize}); adds {@code 3} for a tenure of one or more
365	     * elapsed fiscal years since the {@link #getRegistrationDate() registration date}'s fiscal
366	     * year (the fiscal year starts on 1 July). Not persisted — derived from {@link #getEmail()},
367	     * {@link #getNamesakeCount()}, {@link #getHouseholdSize()} and {@link #getRegistrationDate()}.
368	     */
369	    @Transient
