12	/**
13	 * Shared household rules for the owner-create pipeline. A household is now keyed on
14	 * {@code (lastName, postcode)}: every owner with a postcode derives a deterministic
15	 * {@link Id} from its normalized last name and postcode, so owners with the same last name
16	 * and postcode share the same id automatically, regardless of creation order. The id is
17	 * defined once here so the resolver ({@link ResolveHousehold}), the duplicate gate
18	 * ({@link ValidateUniqueIdentity}) and the new owner ({@link BuildOwner}) all agree on it.
19	 */
20	final class Household {
